#: fm1companion/ui/pages/studio.py:204
msgid "First the app automatically makes a <b>safety backup</b> of this FM-1 (Backups › List). Then the twin replaces on the device: all 32 project slots, the running music and the user presets. Playback on the FM-1 stops in the process."
